{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "9c9274c1-3f85-4f57-9eb5-1e0a0b1cce00"/*SetStringVar*/,
  "Description": "Sets a string variable in the evaluation context that can be read by [GetStringVar] in the connected subgraph.\n\nIf SubGraph is connected, the variable is set while the subgraph is executed and a previous value is restored afterwards. Without a connected subgraph the variable stays set for everything evaluated later.\n\nSee also: [GetStringVar]",
